Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect assignment of the `_errno` field in the `sd_resolve_query` structure, where a negative value (specifically `-EIO`) was being set instead of the intended positive error code. This issue was introduced in a previous commit and led to confusion in error handling, as negative values are not standard for error codes in this context. The patch introduces a helper macro to standardize the assignment of return values and error codes, ensuring that the correct values are set consistently.
